      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help you with framing the statistical evidence. To lend credibility to your hypothesis, you may want to consider using phrases like \"substantially increased\" or \"dramatically improved\" to describe the effects of your intervention. Additionally, using specific numbers and percentages can help illustrate the magnitude of the impact. You could also mention the p-value, confidence interval, or odds ratio to provide a quantitative metric of the strength of the evidence.",
